  "scope": "Complete actual guard-to-terminal adaptive step. The same fixed4800-slot machine constructs the choice, amount, normalized row, objective and best selection, updates weights/total/loads and allocates the literal old six-field state and event. Both guard branches and original padded/zero fields refine the existing BinaryFractionalCore.step. Same-run physical charge includes the terminal attempt and is bounded polynomially in represented original graph order/demand count, current input field widths and physical heap/address bounds. Raw input preparation, delta construction, adaptive fuel/whole-loop width control and full paper completion remain separate. The eight inherited full-state fixtures bind the unchanged program; no new executable instruction was changed.",
